    "custom_liquid_H4izWy": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "custom_css": [
        "* {display: none;}"
      ],
      "name": "t:sections.custom-liquid.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n    {\n    \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n    \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n    \"mainEntity\": [\n      \n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"What is Shilajit?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"Shilajit is a natural substance found in high-altitude mountain regions like the Himalayas. Packed with minerals, it has been used in traditional medicine for boosting health and vitality\"\n        }\n      },\n      \n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"What is in Shilajit?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"Shilajit contains over 85 minerals, including fulvic acid, humic acid, and trace elements that nourish the body and support holistic wellness.\"\n        }\n      },\n      \n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"What is Shilajit made of?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"It is formed from plant matter and minerals that have decomposed over thousands of years, creating a resin-like substance found in cracks of rocks in high-altitude mountain ranges.\"\n        }\n      },\n      \n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"Where does Shilajit come from?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"It is primarily found in the Himalayas of Nepal, especially in regions like Darchula, Solukhumbu, Dolpa, Mugu, and Jajarkot, as well as some areas of the Tibetan Plateau.\"\n        }\n      },\n      \n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"What is Himalayan Shilajit?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"Himalayan Shilajit refers to the version sourced from the Himalayas, renowned for its high quality and potent mineral content, which supports a variety of health benefits.\"\n        }\n      },\n      \n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"How to pronounce Shilajit?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"Shilajit is pronounced as 'shee-lah-jeet.' The emphasis is on the first syllable.\"\n        }\n      },\n      \n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"Where to buy Shilajit?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"It can be purchased from reputable health stores, trusted online marketplaces, or directly from brands that offer high-quality, organic Shilajit. For the best quality, you can also buy directly from Everest Shilajit for purity and authenticity.\"\n        }\n      },\n      \n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"Is Shilajit legit?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"Yes, Shilajit is legit. It has been used in traditional medicine for centuries, and scientific studies support its benefits for energy, health, and overall well-being.\"\n        }\n      },\n      \n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"What is Shilajit used for?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"To improve energy levels, enhance physical performance, boost immunity, and increase mental clarity, making it a holistic health tonic.\"\n        }\n      },\n      \n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"What does Shilajit do?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"Shilajit absorbs the body with minerals and nutrients. It supports energy levels, enhances stamina, boosts the immune system, and aids in mental focus, helping improve both physical and mental health.\"\n        }\n      },\n      \n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"What is Shilajit good for?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"It’s excellent for boosting energy, improving brain function, enhancing strength, supporting immune health, and promoting overall vitality.\"\n        }\n      },\n      \n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"What are the benefits of Shilajit?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"Provides&nbsp; increased energy, enhanced mental clarity, improved physical endurance, stronger immunity, healthy aging, and balanced hormones.\"\n        }\n      },\n      \n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"What does Shilajit do to the body?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"It supplies the body with essential minerals, helping to improve energy, stamina, immune health, and mental clarity, ensuring the body functions optimally.\"\n        }\n      },\n      \n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"What does Shilajit do for men?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"Shilajit supports male health by improving energy, stamina, and muscle strength. It can also enhance fertility, hormone balance, and overall vitality, helping men maintain peak performance physically and mentally.\"\n        }\n      },\n      \n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"Is Shilajit good for women?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"Yes, Shilajit is good for women. It helps enhance energy, support hormonal balance, improve skin health, boost immunity, and promote overall vitality, making it a great supplement for women’s health.\"\n        }\n      },\n      \n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"Does Shilajit help with weight loss?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"While not a direct weight-loss solution, it may aid in weight management by increasing metabolism, reducing fatigue, and improving energy. A healthy diet and exercise should accompany it.\"\n        }\n      },\n      \n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"Does Shilajit work?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"Yes, it effectively provides essential minerals and nutrients, enhancing energy, vitality, and overall health. Regular use helps boost performance, mental clarity, and immunity.\"\n        }\n      },\n      \n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"Does Shilajit actually work?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"Yes, it replenishes the body with vital nutrients and supports wellness. It has been trusted for centuries to enhance vitality and promote well-being.\"\n        }\n      },\n      \n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"How long does it take for Shilajit to work?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"Shilajit may take a few days to a couple of weeks to show noticeable effects, depending on the individual's body. Consistent use is key for best results, especially for energy and overall health.\"\n        }\n      },\n      \n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"How fast does Shilajit work?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"The effects may vary while consuming shilajit, but many report feeling more energetic and focused within a few days of regular use. The full benefits typically appear after consistent use over a few weeks.\"\n        }\n      },\n      \n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"Is Shilajit safe?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"Shilajit is generally considered safe when taken in recommended amounts. However, it is important to use high-quality Shilajit and consult a healthcare provider if you have specific health concerns.\"\n        }\n      },\n      \n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"Is Shilajit good for you?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"Yes, Shilajit is good for overall health. It provides essential minerals, enhances energy, supports cognitive function, and boosts the immune system, promoting physical and mental well-being.\"\n        }\n      },\n      \n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"Is Shilajit FDA approved?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"Shilajit is not FDA-approved as a drug, but it is considered safe as a dietary supplement when sourced from reputable brands that ensure its purity and authenticity.\"\n        }\n      },\n      \n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"Can you take Shilajit while pregnant?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"It’s recommended to avoid taking Shilajit during pregnancy unless advised by a healthcare professional, as its effects on pregnancy and fetal development are not fully researched.\"\n        }\n      },\n      \n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"How to take Shilajit?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"It can be taken by dissolving a small amount (typically a pea-sized portion) in warm water, milk, or tea, or consumed directly under the tongue.\"\n        }\n      },\n      \n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"How to consume Shilajit?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \